OL,3,GNEWSABlind man loses vital equipment in
OL,4,Aflats fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA visually impaired man is among dozens
OL,7,Fof residents unable to go home
OL,8,Ffollowing a fire that tore through the
OL,9,Froof of a block of flats.
OL,11,FRyan Cliffe, who is registered blind,
OL,12,Fhas been staying in temporary
OL,13,Faccommodation since the fire in Keel
OL,14,FHouse, Weymouth, on Sunday.
OL,16,FAlthough his flat was only water
OL,17,Fdamaged, he left with only his phone
OL,18,Fand the clothes he was wearing, and has
OL,19,Fso far been allowed to retrieve just a
OL,20,Ffew essentials.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
